===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[hue]] and [[cry]]'''

# (''formerly'') the [[public]] [[pursuit]] of a [[felon]]; accompanied by [[shout]]s to warn others to [[give chase]]
# {{context|by extension}} a [[loud]] and [[persistent]] public [[clamour]]; especially one of [[protest]] or making some [[demand]]

